        "created_at": "2016-05-10T12:58:09.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I dunno about comics (my vote's for Citizen Dawn's origin story and that Xtreme Prime Wardens title though), but this is the first time I've ever seen those hero challenges and they are&nbsp;<em>nuts</em>. I hope we see those as Steam achievements someday. :)</p>",
